      "content": "Quarkus exposes management endpoints for health checks (via SmallRye Health), metrics (via Micrometer/SmallRye Metrics), and OpenAPI documentation. In dev mode, the Dev UI provides a web console with additional introspection endpoints. These endpoints are served under the /q path by default.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Quarkus Team",
